---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Same Pose, Better View" description="Same moment. Sharper view.">
  <article class="project">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="project-header">
        <h1 class="project-title">Same Pose, Better View</h1>
        <p class="project-tagline">Same moment. Sharper view.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="project-hero">
        <div class="video-wrapper">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/CNyl_ppbZXM"
            title="Same Pose, Better View - AI-generated spec ad"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
            class="hero-video"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-content">
        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>What it is</h2>
          <p>
            A 14-second spec ad for a security camera, built on one split-screen idea: a single fashion moment seen through two cameras. On the left, an editorial fashion view of the model. On the right, a high-angle CCTV view of the same subject at the same instant. No dialogue, no voice-over, just music and a tagline.
          </p>
          <p>
            It is a creative concept for a camera product, not a technical benchmark, and not made for a client.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>What problem it solves</h2>
          <p>
            Camera clarity is hard to communicate in words. This ad skips the explanation and lets the viewer see the difference: same action, same moment, one view that is noticeably sharper than the other.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Core idea</h2>
          <p>
            Both frames show the same event, so the only thing that changes is how well it is seen.
          </p>
          <p>
            The first half of the film is soft and fast. The second half slows down and sharpens, and the clearer CCTV view becomes the payoff.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Structure</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>0–6s: quick, energetic poses, with softer footage and a fashion-film pace</li>
            <li>7–14s: the model continues at a calmer, more natural pace while the image sharpens</li>
            <li>End: tagline, "Same Moment. Sharper View."</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Approach & methods</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Split-screen composition kept readable from start to finish</li>
            <li>Two cameras treated as observers of one event, not two unrelated shots</li>
            <li>Contrast in image clarity as the main visual device, without changing the subject or the scene</li>
            <li>Prompt-driven control of pose timing and pacing across both perspectives</li>
            <li>Music chosen to carry the shift from fast fashion energy to calm clarity</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Tools</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Image generation: GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst, Nano Banana 2.1</li>
            <li>Video generation: Seedance 2.5, Veo 3 Fast</li>
            <li>Sound design & music: ElevenLabs</li>
            <li>Editing & compositing: Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    padding-top: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .project-hero {
    margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  .project-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .content-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .content-section li {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .content-section li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }
</style>
